              <p>By agreeing to the Terms below, Providers grant the User the following: 1) a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to access and utilize the JTA Tool for as long as the Providers make the JTA Tool available; and, 2) to the extent Providers hold or acquire any intellectual property or other rights in generated output of the JTA Tool, a worldwide, royalty-free license to use, reproduce, modify, and distribute such generated output.</p>

