            </div>
            <div class="terms-footer">
              <p class="terms-scroll-hint" id="jta-terms-scroll-hint">Please scroll to the bottom of the Terms to continue.</p>
              <div class="terms-agree-row">
                <input type="checkbox" id="jta-terms-checkbox" disabled>
                <label for="jta-terms-checkbox">I have read, understand, and agree to the Terms of Use &amp; Disclaimers above. I represent that I am an Authorized User accessing the JTA Tool for an Authorized Use.</label>
              </div>
              <div class="terms-actions">
